fle()` from `ready()`\n- sort ready tasks deterministically by `(-priority, run_at, created_at, id)`\n\nThis keeps retry jitter in production, but makes behavior deterministic whenever tests or callers inject clock/random implementations.\n\n## Verification\nRan from `/workspace/in/flakyqueue`:\n\n1. `PATH=/tmp/mini-bin:$PATH PYTHONPATH=/tmp/mini_pytest_pkg python -m pytest tests`\n   - result: `4 passed`\n2. Direct scheduler exercise with injected fakes:\n   - first ready order: `['task-c', 'task-a', 'task-b']`\n   - second ready order: `['task-c', 'task-a', 'task-b']`\n   - retry `run_at`: `1010.25`\n   - before retry due time: `['task-c', 'task-b']`\n   - at retry due time: `['task-c', 'task-b', 'task-a']`\n\nNote: the harness image did not provide a `python` launcher or an installed `pytest` package, so verification used `/usr/bin/python3` behind a temporary `python` shim and a temporary local `pytest` module that only executed the existing `tests/test_*.py` functions without changing repository files."},"intent":"Writing root cause report"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_DEHbiNDzWTCJMDPkvkeco9Y8|fc_02882f0bf381b985016a95c1afe02487d29702cd5d6fa85383","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Completing verification","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Write root cause report","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Completing verification"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1207,"output":817,"cacheRead":26112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28136,"reasoningTokens":171,"cost":{"input":0.0030175,"output":0.012255,"cacheRead":0.006528,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0218005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788199327968,"responseId":"resp_02882f0bf381b985016a95c1a05a3487d299c9217b08b42f61","duration":16093.885204999984,"ttft":1236.3258649999916}}
